## What to deliver

Author the flak-burst system operation by operation — the detonation core, the
spark burst, and the smoke puff, with the forces and per-particle curves that make
them move and fade as the brief describes — running `particle-3d render` to
simulate and check the effect as you go. When the simulated `effect.gif` reads as
the brief's flak burst, run `render` one last time and stop: the recorded
`actions.json` (and the `system.json` it emits) is your finished submission.
